flowchart TD
    A[Ambient pressure sample] --> B{Valid sample?}
    B -->|No| C[Discard invalid sample]
    B -->|Yes| D[Set live surface baseline]
    D --> E[depth = (Pambient - Psurface) / 10050]
    E --> F{Value plausible?}
    F -->|No| G[Clamp / reject spike]
    F -->|Yes| H[Low-pass smoothing]
    H --> I[Depth output]
    I --> J[Underwater detection]
    J --> K[Session logging]

    G --> L[Keep safe fallback] --> I
